  "stills": {
    "alt": [
      "A desk at night under an orange arm lamp, with an old laptop and a small television. The television shows a hot air balloon on a blue sky with desktop icons over it.",
      "Close on the television, where desktop icons sit on the balloon and a channel caption reads Icons hide the best part.",
      "The picture lifts out of the television and the balloon rises from it with a warm glow.",
      "The picture slides clear of the icons above a yellow notepad typed with Scooch slides the picture clear.",
      "Soft clouds grow around each group of icons, next to a sticky note that reads Clouds grow around your icons.",
      "An icon is dragged next to the balloon, the picture slides clear again and the clouds follow it.",
      "The picture stretches very wide and then tall, with the icons in a column and then a row, under the words Any picture, any screen written in the light on the wall.",
      "The picture flies to the laptop, which shows two swans with islands, and on to a large old television showing the moon in a sky with clouds.",
      "A slow low pass along the desk over the tape player, the clock and the light from the blinds.",
      "The lamp is off and the screens are the only light. The alarm clock dial reads No CPU at rest.",
      "A high wide shot of every screen on the desk with the line Mac, Windows and Linux and an install button."
    ]
  },
